# Caisson Yard (CIPlay caisson_yard): the yard, the foreman's board, crane 2 (by the zipline), the smelter chest, the
# fuel shed, the anchor gear, the trench chart.
island Caisson Yard
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Caisson Yard
zone yard
expect step 1
read Foreman's board
expect step 2
zone crane_2
expect step 3
open Smelter chest
wait 3
expect step 4
open Fuel shed chest
wait 3
expect step 5
open Anchor gear chest
wait 3
expect step 6
read Trench chart
expect done
